    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bearly Alive</strong> \u2013 Defend. Shoot. Avenge.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Bearly Alive</strong>, food is infinite... but at what cost? You play as a gummy bear returning from the grave, determined to avenge your people after being sacrificed to the God of Food. Once a respected community, the gummy bears lost everything\u2014now, it's time to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>intense mix of Tower Defense and Third-Person Shooter</strong> challenges you to build strategic defenses while diving into action-packed combat against relentless waves of enemies who want to invade your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d1 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25a3 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25d0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Tower Defense + TPS</strong> \u2013 Set up traps and turrets, but also take matters into your own hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Relentless enemy hordes</strong> \u2013 Face increasingly challenging waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>The revenge of a sweet warrior</strong> \u2013 Uncover the dark truth behind a world that thrives on gummy bear suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>An eldritch arsenal</strong> \u2013 Wield unique weapons and special abilities to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d1 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25a3 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25d0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the gummy bears is in your hands. Will you break the cycle and restore your people's honor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>The feast is over. Now it\u2019s time for revenge!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bearly Alive</strong> \u2013 Defend. Shoot. Avenge.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Bearly Alive</strong>, food is infinite... but at what cost? You play as a gummy bear returning from the grave, determined to avenge your people after being sacrificed to the God of Food. Once a respected community, the gummy bears lost everything\u2014now, it's time to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>intense mix of Tower Defense and Third-Person Shooter</strong> challenges you to build strategic defenses while diving into action-packed combat against relentless waves of enemies who want to invade your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d1 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25a3 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25d0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Tower Defense + TPS</strong> \u2013 Set up traps and turrets, but also take matters into your own hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Relentless enemy hordes</strong> \u2013 Face increasingly challenging waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>The revenge of a sweet warrior</strong> \u2013 Uncover the dark truth behind a world that thrives on gummy bear suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>An eldritch arsenal</strong> \u2013 Wield unique weapons and special abilities to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d1 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25a3 \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501 \u25d0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the gummy bears is in your hands. Will you break the cycle and restore your people's honor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>The feast is over. Now it\u2019s time for revenge!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
